  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProjectCircle.Systems.RegionInfo
  regionName: Isosceles Terraces
  showNameOnEnter: 1
  devCape: 1
  devAbilities: 15
  devFlags:
  - Seal.Warden
  notes: "Middle-rank tiers of ISOSCELES triangles: each tier 4-6 units higher (rank
    = height); the upper tiers need the double jump.\nThe Mirror is at the quiet
    bottom entrance. An Overseer watches from a perch over the top tier.\nTop tier,
    left: the hall of the Twin Isosceles (building). Right: the Seal Gate (2 Vertex
    Seals) \u2192 Equilateral Spire.\nHidden: a high ledge above the second tier;
    jump up its shaft to reach the Square's Refuge."
